=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Rala Waterways} and fight {m:Plantpassage Slugs|Plantpassage Slug} there until they utilize the **Fuscous Ooze** special attack.
** These are located in the South-East part of Rala Waterways, which is most easily accessed from (F-7) {z:Eastern Adoulin}. (the {z:south-east entrance/exit|Rala Waterways} seems like it will never be implemented, unfortunately)
* After being hit with **Fuscous Ooze**, the assignment will be complete.
** **Fuscous Ooze** is a conal attack, and will clear this assignment for anyone who gets hit with it.
* It is possible to bring one or both of the {m:Plantpassage Slugs|Plantpassage Slug} from the L/M-8 area to the F-7 {z:Eastern Adoulin} entrance to {z:Rala Waterways}
** You will aggro all the mobs on the way back. It may be best to have a friend sleep the {m:Plantpassage Slug} once you reach the entrance and let the other adds despawn after you get KOd or you zone out.
* To optimize time, bank imprimaturs in other coalition assignments (canceling will return them to you) until you can do 6-7 runs in a row (20+ imprimaturs) to complete Petitioner rank
** If one person holds the {m:Plantpassage Slug}, you can clear the assignment, Warp II to Western Adoulin HP #1, Waypoint #3 to Mummers, turn in/get new assignment, Waypoint to Eastern Adoulin #4, and enter again, repeating until you rank up.
** The {p:Slug|Category:Slug} family only has three TP moves, so you can let it get TP from hitting you or by hitting it with a spell like Dia.

